@7105 = ~Hybridization~
@7106 = ~Hybridization (Transmutation)
Level: 10
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

Hybridization draws on Unleash the Beast while limiting the transformation it causes. It imbues the warlord with all the powers of his fiendish ancestor without completely changing his form. His skin hardens and takes on a reddish hue, his muscles swell and his speed increases, his body becomes stronger and his mind sharpens, but he remains human.
Specifically, the effects of the spell are:
Greater stature, more imposing and impressive: +3 strength, +2 constitution and +2 charisma.
Quicker reactions: +2 dexterity, +4 movement, +1 saving throw vs. breath weapon and wands and his attacks per round set to 5.
A sharper, more thoughtful mind: +2 intelligence, +1 wisdom and +2 save vs. spell.
A more resilient body: +4 AC, immunity to poison, +75% fire resistance, +40% cold resistance, +20% magic resistance, +2 saving throw vs. death and +1 saving throw vs. polymorph. Immunity to normal weapons and magical weapons of +1 enchantment or less and regeneration of 1 hit point per round.~
@71061 = ~Hybridization (Transmutation)
Level: 10
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

Requirement: Arcane Research

Hybridization draws on Unleash the Beast while limiting the transformation it causes. It imbues the warlord with all the powers of his fiendish ancestor without completely changing his form. His skin hardens and takes on a reddish hue, his muscles swell and his speed increases, his body becomes stronger and his mind sharpens, but he remains human.
Specifically, the effects of the spell are:
Greater stature, more imposing and impressive: +3 strength, +2 constitution and +2 charisma.
Quicker reactions: +2 dexterity, +4 movement, +1 saving throw vs. breath weapon and wands and his attacks per round set to 5.
A sharper, more thoughtful mind: +2 intelligence, +1 wisdom and +2 save vs. spell.
A more resilient body: +4 AC, immunity to poison, +75% fire resistance, +40% cold resistance, +20% magic resistance, +2 saving throw vs. death and +1 saving throw vs. polymorph. Immunity to normal weapons and magical weapons of +1 enchantment or less and regeneration of 1 hit point per round.~

@7107 = ~Antimagic Shield~
@7108 = ~Antimagic Shield (Abjuration)
Level: 10
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a shield of magical runes around the caster. Each rune represents a type of magic, and absorbs it if it has to strike the protected wizard. There is no limit to the number of spells absorbed by each rune, as long as the spell lasts, the wizard is protected against all spells, except those he wishes to act, those which are not affected by magic resistance, and supernatural abilities of creatures.~
@71081 = ~Antimagic Shield (Abjuration)

Requirement: Arcane Research

Level: 10
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a shield of magical runes around the caster. Each rune represents a type of magic, and absorbs it if it has to strike the protected wizard. There is no limit to the number of spells absorbed by each rune, as long as the spell lasts, the wizard is protected against all spells, except those he wishes to act, those which are not affected by magic resistance, and supernatural abilities of creatures.~

@7109 = ~Major Chaos Strike~
@71010 = ~Major Chaos Strike (Evocation, Alteration, Necromancy)
Level: 10
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: one target
Saving Throw: special

This spell combines the warlord's mastery of the elements with his Ghost Strike spells.
Described as "Wrath of the Warlord", it is the ultimate spell of destruction, which the caster reserves for his worst enemy. The spell requires so much magical energy that casting it makes the warlord forget 3 spells: this one and two others. He is also exhausted, and if he fails a save vs. death, he suffers -2 to all rolls for 4 turns.
Once the spell is cast, the designated target is hit by 6 energy spears made of the essence of chaos.

The first strike inflicts 2D6 piercing damage and reduces resistance of the creature: all saving throws suffer a 1D4 +2 penalty thereafter.
The second strike inflicts 2D6 piercing damage and 2D8 magic damage. Magic resistance and magic damage resistance of the target are reduced by 40% for 1 turn (20% in case of a successful save vs. spell).
The third strike inflicts 2D6 piercing damage and 1D6 fire, cold, acid and electricity damage. The target gets elemental resistance reduced by 50% for 1 turn (25% in case of a successful save vs. spell).
The fourth strike inflicts 2D6 piercing damage and 4D8 negative energy damage. The victim loses two levels of experience, only one in case of a successful save vs. death.
The fifth strike inflicts 2D6 piercing damage and 2D8 fire, cold, acid and electricity damage. The convergence of energy atomizes the target if it fails a save vs. death at -2.
The sixth blade passes right through the target, inflicting 4D6 points of piercing damage and tearing the fabric of reality. The victim changes status, location, and time if it fails a saving throw vs. polymorph at -4. If the saving throw fails, the target becomes something else, somewhere else, sooner or later.

CAUTION: If the veil of reality is scratched, the actions related to the target could not work anymore (script, dialogues, etc..) and disrupt your game. Do not use this spell on special targets such as Demogorgon or the Hand, as an example.~
@710101 = ~Atomized.~
@710102 = ~Become something else in another place and time.~
@710103 = ~Major Chaos Strike (Evocation, Alteration, Necromancy)

